# Thirty-two connections (STEP_MOUNTS=2) with half the held buffer: 32 x
# 512 KiB is the data in receive memory that 16 x 1 MiB is, so the cell
# differs from 16k-32-best.plan in the number of connections and not in
# the footprint.  Run by conns-watch.sh 2 <outdir> <this plan>.
512 524288 0 prp step-copy-n16
